Package: octool-hwio-dkms
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: OCTool maintainers <octool@example.invalid>
Depends: dkms (>= 2.8), gcc, make, kmod, libc6-dev, libelf-dev, linux-headers-amd64 | linux-headers-generic | linux-headers
Recommends: mokutil, openssl
Description: OCTool hardware access module sources for DKMS
 Rebuilds against installed target kernel headers; preserves /dev/mydev MMIO ABI.
